flowchart LR
  U[Authenticated requester] -->|image and exact model version| API[Inference API]
  API -->|OIDC workload token| MLOPS[MLOps approved-version endpoint]
  MLOPS -->|approved version, artifact digest| API
  API -->|read-only mount| PKG[Private checksummed package]
  API --> PRE[Package-matched preprocessing]
  PRE --> RUN[PyTorch TorchScript or TensorFlow SavedModel]
  RUN --> POST[Task output interpretation]
  POST --> RES[Structured prediction and disclaimer]
  RES --> AUDIT[Prediction metadata and input digest]

